      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It'd be better if you created one for each of these, rather than one massive one for all.\n\nBesides;\n\nPost Processing https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/post-processing-support\n\nAvatar API, a partial request has been filled for it; https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/request-vrcplayer-api-avatar-rating\n\nAs for dynamic bones, nothing there has been created for the Udon side, though, this would be client side features for avatars and best requested in https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-20T15:21:10.865Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add support for post processing, VRChats avatar api, and dynamic bones\nPost processing is an obvious one which has already been requested as it would allow the already existing post processing customisation to be setup in a much easier and better way.\nWith support for VRChats avatar api, people could do stuff with performance ratings, display author of current avatar by getting author name as well as many other possibilities.\nDynamic bones would be a nice little extra just so that people can add a little more variety to optimisation settings in their worlds, such as setting the update rate lower on everyone, or the opposite and highering update rate.",
